<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Roblox YAF Star run and throw VIP plus premium and fast run</Major>
    <Description>This macro is a simple star run/throw/rocket boost macro for Yeet A Friend in Roblox.
The macro immediately resets the character in order to get the movement controls and direction back to default. 
Then the macro runs all over the normal area, then the VIP area and then back to the normal area. 
Then it crosses the "yeet here" line and throws. After Throwing, the macro causes the player to jump while moving back around to gather stars which uses the rocket boost.

Suggestions are: 
-- only use this macro if you purchased roblox premium (gives you extra movement speed) and if you've bought the extra speed option from the store in-game. The way the delays are set in this macro they will not navigate properly at a lower speed. You can try extending the delays if you dont have the extra speed.
-- only use this if you've ppurchased access to the VIP area. The macro will run into the VIP area and if it isn't available it will be MUCH less effective. There are lots of other macros here that don't include the VIP area.
-- turn off the live yeeting view before starting
-- I haven't tested it as much with auto-throw enabled, but as of right now I wouldn't recommend it.
-- equipping multiple pets with star gazer will ensure you end up with MANY, MANY moire stars than you would otherwise. I also equip one magnetic pet to ensure I get all of the ones on the map.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
